# --- Runtime output (DL-024) ---
# New uploads written by the app are ignored so user documents never reach version
# control. The 12 sample files that shipped with the project are un-ignored by exact
# name so they stay tracked. Add new fixtures here explicitly if you want them kept.
uploads/*
frontend/build/
build/
!.gitkeep

